This directory contains various scripts ranging from instances of
Grover's quantum search algorithm to canonical two-qubit
decomposition.

Scripts
-------

and20.qpro: Simulates the ANDing of 20 qubits in an equal
            superposition

grover_density.qpro: A 22-qubit instance of Grover's quantum search algorithm

large_h.qpro: A 50-qubit Hadamard operator applied to a 50-qubit density
              matrix

two_q_canonical.qpro: A simple application of canonical two-qubit
		      decomposition
